        <mxCell id="integrity_note" value="&lt;b&gt;DATA INTEGRITY NOTES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• ORDER_ITEMS should reference a valid order and product.&lt;br&gt;• Store password hashes, never plaintext passwords.&lt;br&gt;• Use DECIMAL for currency and validate stock / quantity values.&lt;br&gt;• Define appropriate ENUM values and deletion rules in the database schema." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=8;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#334155;fontSize=12;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
